  "wasteHowTitle": "How this works and its limits",
  "wasteHowBody": "With at least 6 months of electricity and production data, the app fits a straight line of kWh against production. For each month it predicts the expected kWh from the other months and a 95% range. Months above the range are flagged.\n\nWithout production data it compares each month with your typical month. This is less reliable.\n\nLimits:\n• Only monthly totals, a small sample: results are indicative.\n• Without sub-metering it cannot tell which machine used the extra electricity.\n• It flags statistical outliers; it cannot identify the cause.\n• Product mix, working hours, weather or new machines can explain a flag.",
